@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
<p class="text-muted">Last updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM yyyy")</p>

<h5 class="mt-4">Information We Collect</h5>
<p>
    To provide our vehicle rental services, we collect your name, email, phone number,
    date of birth, and driving license details (number and expiry date). This information
    is used solely to verify eligibility to rent a vehicle and to manage your bookings.
</p>

<h5 class="mt-4">How We Use Your Information</h5>
<p>
    Your information is used to create and manage your account, process bookings,
    calculate rental charges, and verify your eligibility to drive (age and valid license)
    before confirming a booking.
</p>

<h5 class="mt-4">Data Security</h5>
<p>
    Passwords are never stored in plain text — they are hashed using industry-standard
    BCrypt hashing before being saved. We do not share your personal information with
    third parties.
</p>

<h5 class="mt-4">Your Data</h5>
<p>
    You may contact the site administrator to review, update, or request deletion of
    your personal information at any time.
</p>

<p class="text-muted mt-4">
    This is a college academic project. This policy is provided for demonstration
    purposes and reflects the data handling practices implemented in this system.
</p>